; Axis B (cross-ref symbol-slot lookup) — negative direction.
;
; No `(phrase)` instance exists, so the cross-ref registry for
; `phrase` is empty. The `track` form has `:anchor` defaulting to
; the symbol `ghost`. With axis B off, the omitted kvpair triggers
; no slot check — clean. With axis B on, the overlay-driven lookup
; searches for `ghost` in an empty registry and fails ->
; `not_cross_ref` at `[track, anchor, default]`.
;
; `expected.sjon` matches the axis-off baseline (clean).
(plugin :name probe :version "1.0.0"
  (value-kind :name phrase-name
    :underlying symbol
    :cross-ref (cross-ref :target phrase))
  (form :name phrase
    (key :name name :type symbol :optional false))
  (form :name track
    (key :name anchor :type phrase-name :default ghost :optional true)))

(track)
